==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*4 [[Pigge]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*6 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[One Horn]]s spawn after 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*1 [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Bring your anti-red tanks and units. As this is a very early game stage, [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Ninja]] is rather helpful here, and so is [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Axe Cat]]. This stage isn't too hard due to the lack of any serious enemy respawning.

